::JOUR_U04_L01_Q_Q01::[MLA.JOUR.MED.01] Source: Headline: New Bike Rack Area Opens Near East Gate. Subheading: The school adds marked parking spaces and a short safety checklist for student cyclists. Body: The school opened a new bike rack area near the east gate on Monday. The article begins with the schedule change, then explains why the location was chosen, then lists safety reminders. A sidebar titled Before You Ride reminds students to lock bikes, walk bikes on sidewalks, and use helmets. A photo caption identifies the east gate entrance and notes that the rack area is visible from the front office. A map shows the route from the bike racks to the main courtyard. Question 1: Which feature best supports audience navigation? {
